item.description:
A type of light therapy popular in skincare could be a game changer for people undergoing IVF. Meet the first dad in the US to use a new device that helps parents bond with their premature babies. A livestream of newborn puppies is so popular in Finland, it had more views last year than the country has people. A new study offers hope for restoring damaged coral reefs. Plus, what a tiny “immortal jellyfish” could teach us about treating age-related illnesses.&nbsp;

Host/Producer: Krista Bo Polanco&nbsp;

Producer: Eryn Mathewson&nbsp;&nbsp;

Senior Producer: Felicia Patinkin&nbsp;

Editorial Support: Ava Bambuck, Jacqueline Howard, Lacey Russell&nbsp;
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices

